WEBVTT

00:01.110 --> 00:02.480
Here we go.

00:02.810 --> 00:05.110
Haruto, watch the sky!

00:18.400 --> 00:19.360
Rio...

00:42.020 --> 00:44.610
SEIREI GENSOUKI - SPIRIT CHRONICLES SEASON 2

01:45.160 --> 01:47.090
Do you mind if I participate...

01:47.090 --> 01:49.880
...in the evening party in Galarc
which will reveal the Hero?

01:50.650 --> 01:53.130
I'd like to meet with Satsuki Sumeragi.

01:57.350 --> 01:58.480
It's over.

02:00.090 --> 02:02.940
We can lift off our magic here.

02:02.940 --> 02:04.150
O-Okay!

02:13.930 --> 02:15.520
Haruto will be fine.

02:15.950 --> 02:17.410
Aishia...

02:21.200 --> 02:22.870
TO THE DESTINED TOMORROW

02:22.870 --> 02:24.270
TO THE DESTINED TOMORROW
They got away...

02:24.270 --> 02:25.080
TO THE DESTINED TOMORROW
Damn...

02:25.440 --> 02:27.020
U-Um...

02:28.000 --> 02:29.210
Master Rio...

02:29.960 --> 02:32.980
You're Master Rio, aren't you?

02:32.980 --> 02:35.130
I've always wanted to apologise...

02:35.780 --> 02:38.550
I've always wanted to thank you...

02:39.130 --> 02:41.060
For what?

02:41.480 --> 02:44.470
For what happened
in the Academy in the past!

02:44.470 --> 02:48.440
You saved me from danger,
but I haven't been able to thank you...

02:48.440 --> 02:52.200
And you were also falsely accused...

02:52.660 --> 02:55.150
Making you have to leave the Academy...

02:56.010 --> 02:57.560
I don't think I have a reason...

02:57.560 --> 03:01.460
...for you to thank or apologise to me.

03:01.900 --> 03:03.670
Forgive my rudeness.

03:06.580 --> 03:09.760
Am I... bothering you?

03:09.760 --> 03:11.740
Not at all.

03:11.740 --> 03:17.880
However, if you think I owe you
a gratitude or apology,

03:17.880 --> 03:21.260
please, forget the man called Rio.

03:21.930 --> 03:23.710
That's all I need.

03:24.500 --> 03:26.640
I... understand.

03:27.070 --> 03:29.330
I'm sorry...

03:29.330 --> 03:32.280
I asked you something strange
out of a misunderstanding...

03:32.820 --> 03:34.030
I'm sorry.

03:34.500 --> 03:36.780
I can't just admit it myself.

03:37.380 --> 03:39.020
I'll take you to the manor.

03:40.930 --> 03:42.330
Please do.

03:52.140 --> 03:53.550
Thanks to you two,

03:54.110 --> 03:57.300
we could reduce the casualties
at the manor to the minimum.

03:57.700 --> 04:01.950
Oh, we didn't do anything.

04:01.950 --> 04:04.310
The situation hasn't fully resolved yet.

04:04.990 --> 04:07.640
You'd better think of what follows now.

04:07.640 --> 04:09.060
You have a point.

04:09.460 --> 04:11.100
Thank you.

04:11.100 --> 04:14.130
I also have healing magic,

04:14.130 --> 04:16.240
so feel free to ask if you need it.

04:16.240 --> 04:17.320
That'll be helpful.

04:18.070 --> 04:19.820
This way, please.

04:22.560 --> 04:24.830
How are things outside?

04:25.250 --> 04:28.830
Please refrain from speaking, Duke Huguenot.

04:31.490 --> 04:33.590
Lady Liselotte!

04:34.610 --> 04:36.530
Duke Huguenot...

04:37.460 --> 04:41.090
Roanna, you fill her in...

04:41.630 --> 04:44.810
Let me take your place, then.

04:44.810 --> 04:46.360
Who are you?

04:48.300 --> 04:49.770
I'm a helper.

04:51.170 --> 04:52.200
Heal.

04:54.620 --> 04:57.530
Demons have breached through this room.

04:57.900 --> 05:01.280
We could fend them off somehow
thanks to Master Hiroaki,

05:01.630 --> 05:04.510
but Duke Huguenot is heavily injured...

05:04.930 --> 05:08.110
Is the Hero safe?

05:08.110 --> 05:10.790
I think he's just passed out.

05:11.320 --> 05:12.490
All right.

05:12.950 --> 05:15.160
By the way, where's Princess Flora?

05:15.720 --> 05:18.300
When we were attacked
by the demons in the garden,

05:18.300 --> 05:23.250
an unknown man emerged from inside
the manor and kidnapped her,

05:23.250 --> 05:25.440
and escaped out of the building.

05:25.440 --> 05:27.440
What?!

05:27.440 --> 05:29.540
But Master Haruto...

05:29.540 --> 05:33.230
He's now going after them alone.

05:33.610 --> 05:38.340
S-So... I tried to let her escape...

05:38.970 --> 05:40.820
But then that man...

05:40.820 --> 05:44.200
What did I just do...

05:44.650 --> 05:48.980
Roanna, your decision was
most just in that situation!

05:48.980 --> 05:51.360
We just have to believe in Haruto...

05:53.260 --> 05:55.710
Are you okay, Duke Huguenot?

05:55.710 --> 05:58.410
Please, don't force yourself...

05:58.410 --> 06:03.800
No, I can tell the pain is gone in an instant.
You have quite the skill.

06:03.800 --> 06:08.310
The lady over there has administered
first aid to you before.

06:08.970 --> 06:12.450
Get some rest, and you will be fine.

06:14.800 --> 06:16.430
Haruto is back.

06:16.430 --> 06:16.940
Huh?

06:21.470 --> 06:23.020
Haruto!

06:23.020 --> 06:25.620
I'm sorry for making you worry.

06:25.620 --> 06:26.820
It's okay.

06:27.300 --> 06:28.780
Welcome back.

06:29.170 --> 06:31.950
Master Haruto!
Lady Flora!

06:31.950 --> 06:35.160
As promised,
I have brought back the princess.

06:35.620 --> 06:39.250
Unfortunately,
the culprit got away from us.

06:39.740 --> 06:42.990
Even if you only managed
to bring Lady Flora back alive,

06:42.990 --> 06:45.760
I still can't thank you enough.

06:46.100 --> 06:50.070
Then, can I leave her to you?

06:50.070 --> 06:51.370
Of course.

06:51.770 --> 06:56.010
Would you like to come
to rest inside the manor for now?

06:56.010 --> 06:57.660
I will.

06:57.660 --> 06:58.760
Well, Lady Flora...

06:58.760 --> 06:59.770
U-Um...

07:00.150 --> 07:02.280
My legs gave out...

07:02.940 --> 07:04.780
I'm sorry for that.

07:05.140 --> 07:06.700
Understood.

07:06.700 --> 07:10.920
I'll take her to the manor like this, then.

07:10.920 --> 07:13.020
Please do.

07:14.210 --> 07:15.890
I'm counting on you, Haruto.

07:22.220 --> 07:25.720
So, about the man
who kidnapped the princess...

07:25.720 --> 07:29.720
Did you notice anything
about him, Master Haruto?

07:30.100 --> 07:33.150
I'm aware of his true identity.

07:33.150 --> 07:34.180
Or rather...

07:34.870 --> 07:37.120
I knew that guy.

07:37.120 --> 07:38.700
Is that so?

07:38.700 --> 07:40.980
Yes. When he appeared in the manor,

07:41.670 --> 07:44.150
I noticed a familiar voice.

07:44.150 --> 07:47.910
So, you know what his name is?

07:48.380 --> 07:49.670
It's Lucius.

07:50.390 --> 07:52.030
How in the world...

07:52.030 --> 07:54.400
...did you know him?

07:54.400 --> 07:57.220
I bear a grudge against him
for what he did in the past.

07:58.140 --> 08:00.130
In the past?

08:00.130 --> 08:04.130
My apologies, I wasn't being considerate.

08:04.850 --> 08:05.610
Not at all.

08:11.930 --> 08:14.020
Have a taste of your own medicine.

08:14.970 --> 08:17.850
The physical wounds
are just too intense.

08:18.290 --> 08:19.650
There's no going around it.

08:20.030 --> 08:24.110
We can't afford to let you die yet.

08:24.110 --> 08:26.160
Damn...

08:26.160 --> 08:29.110
Had I had my left arm,
I would've won...

08:29.710 --> 08:31.750
Just give it up.

08:31.750 --> 08:35.900
With your current strength,
you won't stand a chance against him.

08:36.740 --> 08:40.370
I see you belittled his power, no?

08:40.820 --> 08:44.880
It is wisest now to just accept our defeat.

08:44.880 --> 08:46.220
Huh?!

08:46.220 --> 08:50.760
You should refrain from
at least dealing with him for now.

08:50.760 --> 08:52.950
It is best not to interfere.

08:52.950 --> 08:54.910
Say what?!

08:54.910 --> 08:57.390
I won't take no as an answer.

08:57.390 --> 09:01.150
For you were weak against him.

09:01.580 --> 09:03.170
Princess Flora!

09:05.630 --> 09:06.690
Roanna!

09:07.110 --> 09:09.740
Lady Flora, I'm glad you're well!

09:09.740 --> 09:11.950
Please use this chair.

09:15.240 --> 09:17.140
I'll put you down, then.

09:17.140 --> 09:19.950
Okay. Thank you.

09:22.330 --> 09:24.910
Haruto, you have my gratitude.

09:24.910 --> 09:25.590
It's nothing.

09:26.360 --> 09:28.470
We'll be on our way, then.

09:29.770 --> 09:31.340
We should help those outside.

09:31.340 --> 09:32.130
Okay.

09:32.130 --> 09:33.820
Please wait!

09:33.820 --> 09:37.350
Most of my attendants
are on their way back now,

09:37.690 --> 09:40.150
so you three should get some rest.

09:40.150 --> 09:43.760
We'll prepare a room for you.

09:43.760 --> 09:44.980
That's great.

09:44.980 --> 09:47.540
Don't worry about us, just go, Liselotte.

09:47.540 --> 09:50.370
I'll ask Lady Flora about the details later.

09:50.370 --> 09:51.990
Thank you.

09:51.990 --> 09:56.330
We'll rearrange for another meeting later,

09:56.330 --> 09:58.740
and we hope to be able
to exchange information then.

09:58.740 --> 09:59.600
Yes.

09:59.600 --> 10:04.250
Would you be willing to participate as well
for the occasion, Master Haruto?

10:04.660 --> 10:06.380
Of course.

10:06.900 --> 10:09.780
For saving Lady Flora,

10:09.780 --> 10:13.340
I want to thank you properly as well there.

10:13.750 --> 10:16.110
I appreciate the sentiment.

10:16.610 --> 10:18.720
We'll excuse ourselves, then.

10:24.060 --> 10:27.060
SEIREI GENSOUKI - SPIRIT CHRONICLES SEASON 2

10:30.200 --> 10:31.150
Have a cuppa.

10:33.460 --> 10:34.930
This is good.

10:34.930 --> 10:37.040
Just like what Haruto used to make.

10:37.040 --> 10:40.830
I am his mentor, after all!

10:40.830 --> 10:41.910
Right, Rio?

10:42.550 --> 10:44.560
Rio, are you listening?

10:44.560 --> 10:46.140
Yes.

10:46.140 --> 10:47.530
I mean...

10:48.530 --> 10:49.880
Princess Flora...

10:50.480 --> 10:52.490
She found out about me.

10:52.490 --> 10:54.880
Huh? Really?

10:55.700 --> 10:58.100
No wonder she was behaving like that...

10:59.090 --> 11:01.660
So, what happened to her?

11:01.660 --> 11:04.720
I asked her to forget about Rio,

11:04.720 --> 11:07.100
and I think she's on board with that.

11:07.100 --> 11:11.110
In that case, I don't think she'll ever
tell this to anyone for no reason.

11:11.750 --> 11:14.260
That's what she is, after all.

11:14.260 --> 11:15.870
I'm sure it'll be fine.

11:15.870 --> 11:18.620
All right, if you say so.

11:19.230 --> 11:23.390
Still, it's risky for us
to stay here for long.

11:23.390 --> 11:26.420
We can't afford to have them
find out who you really are too.

11:26.420 --> 11:27.370
Right...

11:28.060 --> 11:33.760
So, when we're done talking with Miss Liselotte,
let's head back to the Spirit village soon.

11:34.220 --> 11:36.890
The Spirit village? That's nice.

11:37.540 --> 11:39.260
Just like I told you yesterday,

11:39.570 --> 11:43.140
Satsuki Sumeragi, Miharu's friend,

11:43.140 --> 11:46.890
is confirmed to be the Hero
summoned to Galarc.

11:47.330 --> 11:49.080
I'd like to report that too.

11:49.670 --> 11:50.760
Okay.

11:51.250 --> 11:52.620
Is this okay with you, Aishia?

11:52.970 --> 11:53.900
Sure.

11:54.360 --> 11:58.410
But, are you sure you want to
head back to the village like this?

11:58.970 --> 12:01.160
I'm sure.

12:01.720 --> 12:02.710
That's that, then.

12:05.960 --> 12:07.440
What's wrong?

12:07.840 --> 12:09.040
Well...

12:09.380 --> 12:10.510
Yes?

12:10.510 --> 12:15.300
What happened between you and Lucius,
who kidnapped the princess?

12:15.850 --> 12:18.050
You said you have a grudge against him.

12:18.460 --> 12:20.710
It's okay if you don't want to say.

12:20.710 --> 12:23.540
I was just a curious, that's all.

12:24.740 --> 12:26.730
I'm avenging my mother.

12:27.310 --> 12:30.230
He killed her in front of me,

12:30.590 --> 12:34.230
and maybe he also killed my father.

12:34.820 --> 12:36.740
Sorry...

12:37.160 --> 12:40.780
I guess I brought back bad memories to you...

12:40.780 --> 12:43.980
Oh, no. I meant to answer you
if you asked me that.

12:43.980 --> 12:46.170
I don't want to lie to you, Master.

12:46.620 --> 12:49.260
But it's no sunshine and rainbows...

12:50.690 --> 12:53.000
I loathe the guy,

12:53.000 --> 12:55.250
and I can never forgive him.

12:55.790 --> 12:59.260
Still, I already have my answer within.

13:00.520 --> 13:03.160
I decided to face him
without running away.

13:03.160 --> 13:04.260
I'll be fine.

13:04.780 --> 13:05.910
Right...

13:06.380 --> 13:10.770
If possible, what's in this room
remains in this room.

13:11.480 --> 13:14.270
There's only a handful of people
who know this.

13:16.480 --> 13:19.280
Thanks for telling us this, Rio.

13:19.600 --> 13:23.010
But you should ask me for advice
if something happens, okay?

13:23.010 --> 13:24.280
I told you before,

13:24.770 --> 13:26.290
but no matter what...

13:26.780 --> 13:28.370
I'll always be on your side.

13:28.810 --> 13:29.610
Okay.

13:32.440 --> 13:38.050
I know a bit of the details regarding
Lucius who took the princess away.

13:38.510 --> 13:40.260
Really?

13:40.940 --> 13:43.890
I don't know where he's operating now,

13:43.890 --> 13:47.270
but he used to be a low-class noble
in our country.

13:47.270 --> 13:49.010
Do you know that?

13:49.480 --> 13:50.810
No, I don't.

13:51.270 --> 13:53.310
His name is Lucius Orgueil.

13:54.060 --> 13:56.460
He was once a candidate
for the King's sword,

13:56.460 --> 14:01.060
and had once traded blows with the current
King's sword, Sir Alfred Emerle.

14:05.630 --> 14:08.410
The reason Lucius wasn't chosen
as the King's sword...

14:08.410 --> 14:11.870
...is that his house fell apart
before he could be appointed.

14:12.210 --> 14:16.130
That means he bears
a strong grudge against Beltrum,

14:16.130 --> 14:18.570
hence his kidnapping Princess Flora.

14:18.570 --> 14:20.960
Man, it's just unjustified resentment.

14:20.960 --> 14:23.390
What a small guy he is.

14:23.390 --> 14:26.630
We're not sure yet about that...

14:26.630 --> 14:29.640
But I'm also concerned
about the man called Reiss.

14:30.330 --> 14:34.580
Reiss... I'm also familiar with that name.

14:34.580 --> 14:37.550
He's an ambassador of the Proxia Empire,

14:37.550 --> 14:40.030
rumoured to be connected
with Marquis Arbeau in secret.

14:40.460 --> 14:43.430
Or perhaps he just has the same name.

14:43.430 --> 14:48.590
According to Princess Flora,
he hid his face with a hood,

14:48.590 --> 14:50.790
but did you see his face, Master Haruto?

14:51.230 --> 14:53.020
Not clearly...

14:53.440 --> 14:55.880
Even if I could see his face,

14:55.880 --> 14:58.920
I can't tell if he's the same person.

14:59.360 --> 15:05.050
That means our best approach is to find Lucius,
whose identity we know now.

15:05.490 --> 15:06.700
You're right.

15:06.700 --> 15:10.340
I'll ask our forces
if they have any contacts.

15:10.340 --> 15:14.310
Which means, I must return
to Rodania for a while.

15:14.740 --> 15:16.580
I'll leave that to you, then.

15:16.580 --> 15:19.160
I'll also investigate this on my end.

15:19.160 --> 15:20.170
Right.

15:20.170 --> 15:21.070
So...

15:21.520 --> 15:25.900
May I ask what your next
schedule will be, Master Haruto?

15:25.900 --> 15:28.370
Actually, I have an urgent business...

15:28.370 --> 15:31.080
So I'll have to leave Amande for some time.

15:31.080 --> 15:35.320
Is that so? In that case...

15:35.320 --> 15:40.250
We'll have to prepare our
tokens of gratitude for you soon, then.

15:40.250 --> 15:45.720
We've only been attacked by demons,
so you and the whole Amande must be busy now.

15:46.540 --> 15:48.900
Please, don't force yourselves.

15:49.310 --> 15:51.760
We can't do that.

15:51.760 --> 15:56.140
It's because you're here
that we can be present now.

15:56.140 --> 15:58.230
Do you have something you want?

15:58.230 --> 16:04.110
To be honest, we have no idea
what to present you as a gift.

16:04.570 --> 16:08.270
In that case, I have a favour
to ask you, Lady Liselotte.

16:08.270 --> 16:09.190
Sure.

16:09.190 --> 16:12.680
If possible, do you mind if I participate...

16:12.680 --> 16:15.870
...in the evening party in Galarc
which will reveal the Hero?

16:15.870 --> 16:19.200
The evening party to reveal the Hero?

16:19.200 --> 16:22.130
It's the one held by our kingdom, right?

16:22.730 --> 16:25.150
You want to go there?

16:25.150 --> 16:27.630
Yes. With my companions.

16:28.440 --> 16:30.980
I want to meet with Satsuki Sumeragi.

16:32.850 --> 16:35.890
A FEW DAYS LATER

16:37.340 --> 16:38.520
Morning...

16:38.940 --> 16:40.230
Good morning.

16:40.230 --> 16:44.440
Masato, you overslept again?
Don't keep us waiting!

16:45.040 --> 16:48.560
Sis Miharu is making omurice today.

16:49.030 --> 16:51.030
Omurice? For real?

16:53.160 --> 16:55.320
After you wash your face and hands, okay?

16:55.320 --> 16:56.600
Okay!

16:57.290 --> 16:58.750
Thank you!

17:04.540 --> 17:06.010
It might be my brother...

17:06.010 --> 17:06.420
Huh?

17:08.730 --> 17:10.180
Nice catch!

17:10.490 --> 17:12.740
That was close, Miharu!

17:12.740 --> 17:15.140
Thanks, Sara!

17:16.510 --> 17:17.640
Latifa?

17:18.250 --> 17:19.740
I'll go welcome him!

17:20.210 --> 17:21.470
Me too!

17:21.470 --> 17:23.100
Gosh...

17:25.910 --> 17:28.170
Let's go, Miharu, Aki.

17:28.540 --> 17:29.400
Yeah!

17:32.030 --> 17:33.980
Bro!

17:37.520 --> 17:39.330
Welcome back.

17:39.330 --> 17:42.260
My brother!

17:43.980 --> 17:45.540
I'm home, Latifa.

17:45.540 --> 17:47.300
Glad to see you well.

17:47.300 --> 17:48.420
Yeah!

17:49.170 --> 17:52.870
Sis Celia, Sis Aishia, welcome back!

17:53.480 --> 17:54.550
We're home.

17:54.910 --> 17:56.560
Rio!

17:58.110 --> 18:00.390
Have you all been well?

18:00.390 --> 18:01.440
Yeah!

18:01.880 --> 18:06.550
Bro Haruto, Sis Celia,
we could finally speak the language!

18:06.550 --> 18:08.380
Right, Sis Aki?

18:08.380 --> 18:10.110
Perfectly!

18:10.110 --> 18:11.620
You can count on us!

18:11.620 --> 18:13.820
You're right.
That's amazing.

18:14.380 --> 18:15.760
Welcome back.

18:15.760 --> 18:20.680
Thanks to all of you,
we could get used to living in this world.

18:21.150 --> 18:22.980
Glad to hear that.

18:22.980 --> 18:26.590
I have something to tell you all as well.

18:27.810 --> 18:30.600
Your upperclassman, Satsuki Sumeragi,

18:30.600 --> 18:34.500
has become a hero in a place
called Galarc Kingdom.

18:34.940 --> 18:36.090
She has?

18:36.590 --> 18:38.540
Wow, so you found her!

18:39.010 --> 18:40.740
Where's our brother?!

18:40.740 --> 18:41.850
Unfortunately,

18:42.300 --> 18:45.220
I still don't know where he is.

18:45.820 --> 18:47.750
I see...

18:48.230 --> 18:51.230
But, knowing that Satsuki is here,

18:51.690 --> 18:55.380
makes it possible that
your brother is here as well.

18:55.980 --> 19:00.800
Okay! Maybe he could be with Sis Satsuki!

19:01.350 --> 19:02.640
Right!

19:02.640 --> 19:03.500
Yeah.

19:04.600 --> 19:06.270
So, in a month,

19:06.270 --> 19:09.710
there will be an evening party
to reveal her as the hero.

19:10.130 --> 19:12.550
I was thinking of attending the party.

19:13.320 --> 19:17.780
So, if you want,
we can go to Galarc together.

19:17.780 --> 19:18.930
For real?

19:19.960 --> 19:23.520
Then let's celebrate it together now!

19:23.910 --> 19:29.150
Right.
You've finally found your lost friend!

19:29.150 --> 19:31.890
This is a huge step!

19:31.890 --> 19:35.560
Rio, Celia, and Lady Aishia
are back here...

19:35.560 --> 19:39.390
Today's really filled with
great things to celebrate!

19:44.590 --> 19:47.900
I came here without
eating Sis Miharu's omurice...

19:47.900 --> 19:49.970
I'll be going ahead, then!

19:49.970 --> 19:53.440
Hey, only eat your share, okay!

19:55.280 --> 19:57.050
Let's go now, Bro.

19:57.460 --> 19:58.300
Yeah.

19:59.500 --> 20:01.810
Haruto, I'm so glad...

20:02.210 --> 20:04.450
You come back here unharmed.

20:05.900 --> 20:07.640
Haruto?

20:10.850 --> 20:11.650
Wait!

20:12.900 --> 20:14.020
Mi...

20:15.330 --> 20:16.400
Haru?

20:22.100 --> 20:25.750
Sis Miharu! He wants your omurice too!

20:26.070 --> 20:30.250
Huh? But I could make your
favourite dish since you're here.

20:30.850 --> 20:33.250
I also love omurice.

20:33.670 --> 20:35.460
Just like Haru...

20:35.890 --> 20:39.010
Well, anything you make is delicious,

20:39.010 --> 20:41.180
I like it all.

20:41.180 --> 20:42.360
Me too!

20:42.360 --> 20:45.470
Me too. It's been a while
since I had your meal.

20:46.350 --> 20:47.500
I'll do my best!

20:51.630 --> 20:53.850
Let's eat!

20:54.450 --> 20:56.500
- This is good!
- The best!

22:37.940 --> 22:39.440
Our guests have arrived.

22:40.990 --> 22:43.110
The Hero of Galarc Kingdom:

22:44.400 --> 22:46.330
Lady Satsuki Sumeragi.

22:48.650 --> 22:50.560
The Hero of Restoration:

22:51.530 --> 22:53.290
Master Hiroaki Sakata.

22:55.040 --> 22:57.410
The Hero of Centostella Kingdom:

22:58.530 --> 23:00.540
Master Takahisa Sendo.

23:03.040 --> 23:05.410
The Hero of Beltrum Kingdom:

23:05.750 --> 23:07.510
Master Rui Shigekura.

23:16.200 --> 23:17.670
Up next...

23:18.150 --> 23:20.630
The Honoured Knight of Galarc Kingdom:

23:21.130 --> 23:22.860
Haruto Amakawa.

23:24.980 --> 23:25.630
Huh?

23:40.020 --> 23:41.590
SEIREI GENSOUKI - SPIRIT CHRONICLES SEASON 2

23:41.590 --> 23:43.600
THANK YOU FOR WATCHING!

23:43.600 --> 23:46.600
ILLUSTRATION BY: FUTAGO MINAZUKI
